"value":3,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5021700","error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-3598180","metric":"price_final","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:44:57Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":3598180,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"currency":null,"divisor":100,"initial":null,"discount_percent":null,"is_free":false,"formatted_final_price":null,"is_free_field_present":false,"is_coming_soon":true,"is_coming_soon_field_present":true},"error_code":"price_not_announced"},{"game_id":"steam-3598180","metric":"review_count","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:44:57Z","status":"ok","value":0,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":3598180,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-3598180","metric":"review_positive_percent","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:44:57Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":3598180,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3598180-1846651706691772","game_id":"steam-3598180","kind":"announcement","title":"Midnight Souls is heading to Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Hey!Steam Next Fest kicks off today, which means you can already hop into the Midnight Souls demo, check out new content, mechanics, and a whole lot more! Make sure to share your thoughts on the game, and if you wanna post your thoughts on social media, don’t forget to use #MidnightSouls so we don’t miss your posts. We really wanna see all ;)Also gotta mention that today you can play 4 more demos from Spaghetti Cat. They’re all different, but totally worth checking out:Brofish Going my way? Spin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:25:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691772","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3598180-1846651706681052","game_id":"steam-3598180","kind":"announcement","title":"The Midnight Souls Demo Is Waiting for You!","summary":"Try the demo before Steam Next Fest begins! You'll find new characters, locations, items, and events.And we almost forgot about the new trailer: What's New in the Demo?Visitor's Guide: The new menu brings together your inventory, map, stats, and quest log. Now you'll always be able to find the garages and the people living in them!More Tactics, Less RNG: Every enemy now has their own combat preferences! Fights should be less of a sweat-inducing experience than before, especially if you find the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T11:20:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681052","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3598180-1843481262704751","game_id":"steam-3598180","kind":"announcement","title":"The Midnight Souls Playtest Is Now Open","summary":"Hey everyone!We still can’t quite believe the day is finally here. The open Midnight Souls playtest is officially live! You will be able to play the game from September 15 to September 22, inclusive.Here’s what’s waiting for you:The entire first chapter is playable, packed with mysteries and unexpected discoveries.Camomile Peaks, day and night: around 6 locations, 10+ characters, and dozens of rooms to explore.Stories and conversations with the town’s wonderfully weird residents, slowly revealin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T14:32:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262704751","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3598180-1842846814453375","game_id":"steam-3598180","kind":"announcement","title":"Off to the Anime Game Festival!","summary":"To celebrate, we'd like to introduce you to the girl our hero met online, and the reason he travels to Camomile Peaks. Sounds romantic, right? And yes, things get a little more complicated than just going on a date.Meet Oxana You’ll meet her ex, have a few drinks with her relatives, uncover some very strange secrets… and try to figure out what’s really going on In this town.The Anime Game Festival 2026 runs from September 8 to 14.Midnight Souls to your wishlist and come discover it alongside oth","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T15:20:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814453375","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3598180-1841579228675309","game_id":"steam-3598180","kind":"announcement","title":"DEV-NEWS 🌙","summary":"A few weeks ago, Midnight Souls got a lot more attention on social media than we expected. It’s really great to see so many people taking an interest in a project. Thank you so much for all the support! ❤️So, what’s happening with the game: To make sure the playtest goes as smoothly as a buttered knife through a Greek pita, we're hunting down bugs and giving them the merciless execution they deserve. All so you won't have to deal with them yourselves.Although… we'll probably leave a couple behin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-24T11:59:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228675309","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3598180-1840310314345686","game_id":"steam-3598180","kind":"announcement","title":"A Message from Charlie","summary":"While the game's developer was busy with... I took over the keyboard.I've got good news.Midnight Souls is part of the Cat Awareness Feline Sale!They told me to mention the event, the discounts, and all the other amazing cat games...But honestly? I only have one question.Have you wishlisted Midnight Souls yet?If not... I'll give you the disappointed cat stare.See you in Midnight Souls.— Charlie 🐾","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-07T17:09:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314345686","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3598180-1835236783559760","game_id":"steam-3598180","kind":"announcement","title":"BIG DEVLOG","summary":"This is my first devlog in this format, but I promise — it'll be worth your time. You'll learn more about the game and where the project currently stands.Enjoy the watch!📖 Text version for those who like to read:How it all beganThe idea for the game came from a sense of nostalgia for an era that's slowly fading away. For the people, the places, the situations — things I wouldn't want to go through again in real life. But in a game? Why not.I wanted to create something that feels like a snapshot ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-11T09:19:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783559760","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3598180-1834602721185106","game_id":"steam-3598180","kind":"announcement","title":"🎉 Thank you for 10,000 wishlists!","summary":"Friends, development is in full swing. But today we want to thank everyone who added our game to their wishlist.We'll have something to surprise you with very soon. Follow us on social media for updates and news: https://taplink.cc/dark_spaghetti_cat Game author Sergey Bolshakov and the Spaghetti Cat teamSee you in Camomile Peaks! ❤️","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-03T15:19:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721185106","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3598180-1833334318569657","game_id":"steam-3598180","kind":"announcement","title":"THE OFFICIAL ANNOUNCEMENT","summary":"Big news! Together with publisher Spaghetti Cat, we're officially announcing the project. To celebrate, we've got a brand new trailer for you — it shows off the gameplay and some exclusive footage from the game. But that's not all. We've also spruced up the store page and made it way prettier. Now our cat Charlie is keeping an eye on your wishlists 👀 The new trailer:Go on a date with the province and find your love. If you survive the night, that is…Don't forget to make Charlie happy — add the g","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-21T17:10:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318569657","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3598180-1831432155565685","game_id":"steam-3598180","kind":"announcement","title":"We're heading to the MGN Indie Game Carnival 2026!","summary":"Big news, friends! Our game has been selected to take part in the MGN Indie Game Carnival 2026. All holiday week long, Midnight Souls will be in the spotlight alongside other cool indie games.Dates: April 30 through May 6.Head over to the festival page, find our game, watch the new teaser, and add it to your wishlist.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-29T16:17:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155565685","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3598180-1811138915427589","game_id":"steam-3598180","kind":"announcement","title":"BEGINNING... almost","summary":"Hi everyone!It's empty and lonely here for now, but soon, in small doses, I'll start sharing about the development process and the efforts involved.In the nearest exciting news: Midnight Souls is currently participating in The Six One Indie Showcase, and next week, it will be at the Tokyo Games Show (which is really awesome)! All signs point to this being the perfect moment to ramp up efforts and start releasing materials about the game, ranging in levels of interestSo stay tuned for updates! So","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-09-19T14:19:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1811138915427589","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3598180":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:00Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:59Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3598180":"2026-10-26T10:40:00Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3598180":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:59Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:59Z","status":"ok",